O2 PRE-EXISTING date/preset validation interaction: after All, end becomes current browser date (captured 2026-09-07 UTC) beyond max 2026-08-28, validity=false and native message 'Value must be 08/28/2026 or earlier.' Subsequent start-only change is prevented by form validation. Initial combined harness timed out here; preserved evidence in results.json postPresetValidity, not represented as passing date-after-preset behavior. Two date changes on valid loaded range succeed/focus correctly. setInsightPreset function byte-identical both master and accepted baseline; shared date-range template byte-identical accepted baseline. Follow-up belongs existing-site attribution, not DI4 scope expansion.
