Limits and durable probes
Automation is necessary, not full screen-reader certification. Inspected six viewport/theme screenshots, explicit AX names/hierarchy, actual keyboard/focus/scroll traces and computed contrast; no real AT user session, no uploads, no persistence mutations. No full suite rerun or visual-polish cycle. Two harness issues were corrected: invalid preset dates isolated/attributed rather than bypassed without disclosure; Tab into browser chrome recorded via activeElement instead of waiting forever for :focus. Theme-settle confirmation was focused, not a second full six-state batch.
